        "created_at": "2018-05-30T00:15:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I haven't read the Hines books, but libriomancy seems awfully powerful to me.&nbsp; What keeps a libriomancer from pulling out Aladdin's lamp, or a plasma rifle, or Shieldbreaker from Saberhagen's novels, or some other ungodly powerful object?</p>",
